---
description: Rules for LiteLLM chat calls inside LLM chat elements.
globs: "**/llm_chat/**/*.py"
---
- LLM chat calls go through LiteLLM. `LLMChatModel.generate_response` converts `MessagePayload` values to `{role, content}` dictionaries and calls `litellm.acompletion`.
- `langchain-text-splitters` splits text in the chunker. It does not perform chat completions.
